<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-CBA sees rise in home loan arrears.</title>
<headline>RTRS-CBA sees rise in home loan arrears.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1996-10-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Commonwealth Bank of Australia (CBA) said on Tuesday that it in the last quarter an increase in household indebtedness had been accompanied by a slight rise in arrears in its home loans and credit card loans.</p>
<p>&quot;There has been an icnrease in these arrears, but they are manageable,&quot; CBA managing director David Murray told the annual meeting in response to a question</p>
</text>
